      "section": "WITCH_Ascension",
      "source_line": 21519,
      "text": "{WITCH_Ascension}\n[EnableEnvironment(great_hall_default)]\n[Teleport(ophelia,gh_audiencemidleft)]\nassert forceConfirmEnding\nForceGameOver(\"The ending!\")"
    },
